CODEGEN.md §3.5, §5.2, DECISIONS 430: an opened @codes enum's places of its sorted codes in its wires, detail::k<E>CodeAt in its .gen.cpp's unnamed namespace, go through the C++ name plan as a name local to that file, so a record renamed like them is E8005.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

/// A destination.
enum Dst @codes(UInt8) { hp = 1, mp = 2 }

/// Named like the places table.
record Other @cpp(name: "kDstCodeAt") {
  /// Its value.
  v: Int
}

emit cpp { out: "@features/a/cpp", namespace: "a", mode: types, open: [Dst] }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8005]  a/a.canon:7:8
